From 61235066cd2d01c97006e8bbbd86dac9902097b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:21:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: everyday top or bottom tilt, raised to 6% when a copy
 is short
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each copy draws a 0.5–4% vertical keystone, either edge. A 19–23 source
miss increases that same side through 4% and 6% and stops when the score
clears 24. A miss or a look fail puts the everyday tilt back.
---
